#: ../../source/users/interface/menu_bar.rst:7
msgid "Menu bar"
msgstr "菜单栏"

#: ../../source/users/interface/menu_bar.rst:9
msgid ""
"The menu bar is placed at top from QElectroTech interface. QElectroTech "
"contains the menus ``File``, ``Edit``, ``Project``, ``Display``, "
"``Settings``, ``Windows`` and ``Help``. Each menu provides many different "
"options."
msgstr ""
"菜单栏位于 QElectroTech 界面顶部。QElectroTech 包含 "
"``File``、``Edit``、``Project``、``Display``、``Settings``、``Windows`` 和 "
"``Help`` 菜单，每个菜单都提供许多不同的选项。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/menu_bar.rst:15
msgid ""
"A brief description of each menu option can be read from `help or "
"information tool bar`_ by hovering over the option with the cursor."
msgstr ""
"有关每个菜单选项的简要说明，可将光标悬停在选项上，从 `帮助或信息工具栏 <help or information tool bar_>`_ 中查看。"

